{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35879","headline":"依韵修睦上人山居十首 七 · 李咸用","name":"依韵修睦上人山居十首 七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"畹兰未必因香折，湖象多应爲齿焚。\n兼济直饶同巨楫，自由何似学孤云。\n秋深栎菌樵来得，木末山鼯梦断闻。\n闲凭竹轩游子过，替他愁见日西曛。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李咸用","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35879.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35879","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}